5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure our future peace of mind, I wish to understand the reporting burdens we are inviting.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree we need a rigorous approach. I am particularly interested in the actual stability of the customer base and the reality of the returns.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I believe we must be prudent about our long-term liquidity. I want to see how we handle follow-on requirements and our credit options.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited! I really want to know if we can actually find the people these companies need without it taking forever!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will be looking into the operational delays. I want to know what actually happens before the first deployment.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom comes from knowing not just what we gain, but what we must maintain. Let us be thorough.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, maintenance is key, but so is the truth of the growth. I will focus on the retention and the audit needs.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Asuka on the importance of truth, but the financial runway of the fund itself is my primary focus today.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Minako, that sounds a bit scary! I just want to make sure we aren't spending all our time on recruiting calls!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I am also interested in the delivery records. I want to see if the promises match the actual arrival dates.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
